{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_103_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "5780615d5ccf9c4444006eac158f7d9dd0a958494c8ae1c6f3a6396759c073cb", "ja": "ねえ雪歩、歩。ふたりは\nチョコアイスとイチゴアイス、\nどっちが好き？", "zh": "雪步、步。你们俩喜欢巧克力冰淇淋，还是草莓冰淇淋？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_103_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8b5bd35c48b6c2b1d745ee30207e88914a95079967d63bebfc6c52f20fb74bf3", "ja": "アイス……？　あっ。\nもしかして、今度ロケに行く\n遊園地のおやつのことかな？", "zh": "冰淇淋……？啊。\n难道是指下次要去外景拍摄的游乐园里的点心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_103_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "e7442359518a308c79db18cdabbcb175d2bcac7bc113dba962d08e89ace8948e", "ja": "うん！\n{$P$}が、\nひとりひとつって言ってたの。", "zh": "嗯！\n{$P$}说过，\n每个人只能拿一个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_103_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5e64972d0a10ed1ca50c2b493f1acf0dd1675c072eb584c4f7af474ee1f4dca6", "ja": "美希、すごい楽しそうだね……。\nアタシなんて、嫌な予感しか\nしなくてさ……ハァ～……。", "zh": "美希看起来玩得好开心啊……我这边却只有不好的预感……唉～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_103_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0b6a5551dc70ab1796739fd4a1b9a7e587d388fbc72b42584f440a2bad385bdb", "ja": "わ、私もだよ、歩ちゃん。\nちょっと憂うつで……ハァ～……。", "zh": "我、我也是，步。稍微有点郁闷……唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
